{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/3c99fbff61e537badf88901cd1d8fd3d.poster.avif?t=1739840210\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/3c99fbff61e537badf88901cd1d8fd3d.webm?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/3c99fbff61e537badf88901cd1d8fd3d.mp4?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOURNEY INTO THE WILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of a young sugar glider on a journey to save his family. Your adventures will take you across vast environments as you discover a vibrant world brimming with life. But beware of the dangers that lie ahead...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/74b348a41defe40457a9074703158737.poster.avif?t=1739840210\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/74b348a41defe40457a9074703158737.webm?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/74b348a41defe40457a9074703158737.mp4?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR OWN NATURE DOCUMENTARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide among the trees, fight dangerous predators, and explore beautiful environments through the eyes of a sugar glider \u2014\u00a0all while a narrator describes your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/a6ab87ece61bec62bcf8796f0eec313d.poster.avif?t=1739840210\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/a6ab87ece61bec62bcf8796f0eec313d.webm?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/a6ab87ece61bec62bcf8796f0eec313d.mp4?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER HIDDEN MYSTERIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through the world and complete the main story, or explore off the beaten path and embark on side quests to uncover AWAY's hidden mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/b43437cc68416f71f2afb15586ee0df3.poster.avif?t=1739840210\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/b43437cc68416f71f2afb15586ee0df3.webm?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/b43437cc68416f71f2afb15586ee0df3.mp4?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT OR FLIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt small prey, fight larger enemies, and use stealth and agility to sneak past apex predators unnoticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/34df847697777d344685349700340a1a.poster.avif?t=1739840210\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/34df847697777d344685349700340a1a.webm?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/34df847697777d344685349700340a1a.mp4?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY AS OTHER ANIMALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the world from a whole new perspective while playing as beetles, lizards, crabs, and more. These rare playable animals are hidden throughout AWAY's environments\u00a0\u2014 can you find them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/59964a358056be74aae03e41c8fac972.poster.avif?t=1739840210\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/59964a358056be74aae03e41c8fac972.webm?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/59964a358056be74aae03e41c8fac972.mp4?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIMENT WITH THE CAMERA MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to Camera mode at any point in the game and capture breathtaking landscapes pictures or surprising wildlife images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/fe1e2b8b2a2d198e6245f860391afd6f.poster.avif?t=1739840210\" width=592 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/fe1e2b8b2a2d198e6245f860391afd6f.webm?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/fe1e2b8b2a2d198e6245f860391afd6f.mp4?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the game now and explore a vast world, play as multiple animals and save your sugar glider family!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHO WE ARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking Walls is a small independent game studio founded by industry veterans in Montr\u00e9al. With decades of experience working on major AAA titles, our small team has spent five years developing AWAY: The Survival Series.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cave Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/750200/8bfedc24340eb3c33e263bc1b63ec62957647618.jpg"},{"name":"Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/750200/035b6ba662daba537b28df9b9652fc619dbed84f.jpg"},{"name":"Fast Learner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/750200/eb4c85406b79990242e68ea05ed8f15bc6ded941.jpg"},{"name":"Floating Leaves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/750200/cb12bbe23d968af06e4bb464587b13a0367b87cc.jpg"},{"name":"Globetrotter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/750200/55fc0e43f92ce63c42996c3cc035910f82c94b89.jpg"},{"name":"Glutton","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/750200/aee31d197fc5f14c8be4c394522b622265215c42.jpg"},{"name":"Halfway Through","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/7502