; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/a6ab87ece61bec62bcf8796f0eec313d.mp4?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER HIDDEN MYSTERIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through the world and complete the main story, or explore off the beaten path and embark on side quests to uncover AWAY's hidden mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/b43437cc68416f71f2afb15586ee0df3.poster.avif?t=1739840210\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/b43437cc68416f71f2afb15586ee0df3.webm?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/b43437cc68416f71f2afb15586ee0df3.mp4?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT OR FLIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt small prey, fight larger enemies, and use stealth and agility to sneak past apex predators unnoticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/34df847697777d344685349700340a1a.poster.avif?t=1739840210\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/34df847697777d344685349700340a1a.webm?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/34df847697777d344685349700340a1a.mp4?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY AS OTHER ANIMALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the world from a whole new perspective while playing as beetles, lizards, crabs, and more. These rare playable animals are hidden throughout AWAY's environments\u00a0\u2014 can you find them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/59964a358056be74aae03e41c8fac972.poster.avif?t=1739840210\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/59964a358056be74aae03e41c8fac972.webm?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/59964a358056be74aae03e41c8fac972.mp4?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIMENT WITH THE CAMERA MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to Camera mode at any point in the game and capture breathtaking landscapes pictures or surprising wildlife images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/fe1e2b8b2a2d198e6245f860391afd6f.poster.avif?t=1739840210\" width=592 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/fe1e2b8b2a2d198e6245f860391afd6f.webm?t=1739840210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/750200/extras/fe1e2b8b2a2d198e6245f860391afd6f.mp4?t=1739840210\" type=\"video